vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GZAnhKnPpCUQ7kNvwGoONBN&_nc_oc=Admv-DMtXij0E0vymd6m_eHGW54yVE0iGjhS9vgJIUgSKTtgqFJk9v3Sv98h3MfZkWw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzBxa0yKKuUzkLRsFMKBTtenZT2TPJuh0Vpuny-zOKh7g&oe=69B6AE54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sMNOInEKEYAQ7kNvwEZCiy5&_nc_oc=Adm1GfeYDv5k_-RSF-7dma_9qLGnWj7JnOPdXL6-AYaVbhe-5SeKJ9cMD5A1c8psJk4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz6FcqfoLcDeAb_ftTsQp-hKmmyGpMopUsN4rbj12of9w&oe=69B6B332"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xFxGKH0vJNAQ7kNvwGwAkbR&_nc_oc=AdmbKUywbmryxhFpjNHa8E8_kdJz_TMVMeJpgE2rz7q-S3yzqqcvHdkBdx7vqKVOaM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxh9yeK6sC-vHC7zBX1UcidTI68jFVEmUlcA-mmeGgaJg&oe=69B6C0D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "